    <string name="consent_back">Back</string>
    <string name="consent_intro">Everything COMMAND asks your consent for is listed here, with when it last changed and who changed it. Nothing else is switched on.</string>
    <string name="consent_footer">Optional features that need their own consent, such as calendar, camera or cloud voices, are not in this version. When one arrives it will be listed here before it can be used.</string>

